# HUVEC 水凝胶成管实验（12 孔板，AsterML v2）

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-huvec
schema: 1
title: HUVEC 成管实验（GelMA 梯度 + VEGF 诱导）
objective: 在 12 孔板上比较 3%、5%、7% (w/v) GelMA 水凝胶基质对 HUVEC 6 h、12 h、24 h 体外成管长度与分枝数的影响。
experimental_unit: 12 孔板单孔
primary_endpoint: 管腔总长度与网状结构数
endpoint_method: 倒置明场显微镜每孔多视野采图定量
endpoint_unit: um
```

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-huvec
schema: 1
title: GelMA 浓度实验分组
rows:
  - id: group-3pct
    name: 3% GelMA + VEGF
    role: treatment
    dose: 3 % w/v
    condition: 3% (w/v) GelMA + 0.25% LAP + 10 ng/mL VEGF
    replicate_count: 4
  - id: group-5pct
    name: 5% GelMA + VEGF
    role: treatment
    dose: 5 % w/v
    condition: 5% (w/v) GelMA + 0.25% LAP + 10 ng/mL VEGF
    replicate_count: 4
  - id: group-7pct
    name: 7% GelMA + VEGF
    role: treatment
    dose: 7 % w/v
    condition: 7% (w/v) GelMA + 0.25% LAP + 10 ng/mL VEGF
    replicate_count: 4
```

```asterlab
kind: instrument_profile
id: inst-uv-405
schema: 1
class: uv_curing
model: 405 nm 光固化灯（365-405 nm）
capabilities:
  - name: photo_crosslinking
    wavelength: 405 nm
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-tube
schema: 1
title: HUVEC 体外成管
endpoint: tube_length
unit: um
group_refs: [group-3pct, group-5pct, group-7pct]
timepoints: [6 h, 12 h, 24 h]
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-huvec
schema: 1
format: 12
topology: plate
assay: assay-tube
groups:
  group-3pct: [A1, A2, A3, A4]
  group-5pct: [B1, B2, B3, B4]
  group-7pct: [C1, C2, C3, C4]
samples:
  A1: HUVEC-3%-1
  A2: HUVEC-3%-2
  A3: HUVEC-3%-3
  A4: HUVEC-3%-4
  B1: HUVEC-5%-1
  B2: HUVEC-5%-2
  B3: HUVEC-5%-3
  B4: HUVEC-5%-4
  C1: HUVEC-7%-1
  C2: HUVEC-7%-2
  C3: HUVEC-7%-3
  C4: HUVEC-7%-4
roles:
  A1: sample
  B1: sample
  C1: sample
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-01-prep
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 01 水凝胶热冷消泡与分装体系计算
assay: assay-tube
timepoints: [6 h]
path: huvec/01-prep
order: 1
uses:
  - ref: inst-uv-405
    role: instrument
blocks:
  - kind: prose
    id: blk-huvec-schedule
    schema: 1
    title: 实验时段提醒（7:30 - 10:00 操作窗）
    tone: tip
    body: 建议 07:30 开始水浴融胶与 3 轮冷热循环脱泡，08:30 完成铺胶光固化并浸泡，10:00 前完成 HUVEC 接种建立 t0。
  - kind: timer
    id: blk-huvec-window
    schema: 1
    title: 早班操作窗口与冷热循环计时
    mode: cycle
    rounds: 3
    phases:
      - name: 80 Cel 水浴溶解
        duration: {value: 5, unit: min}
      - name: 冰上静置降泡
        duration: {value: 10, unit: min}
      - name: 2000 rpm 离心脱泡（无气泡可跳过）
        mode: open
  - kind: calculator
    id: blk-huvec-vegf-dil
    schema: 1
    title: VEGF 因子稀释（100 ug/mL -> 50 ng/mL）
    mode: dilution
    stock: {value: 100, unit: ug/mL}
    target: {value: 50, unit: ng/mL}
    final_volume: {value: 8, unit: mL}
  - kind: calculator
    id: blk-huvec-mix
    schema: 1
    title: 12 孔板铺胶反应体系分装（含 15% 余量）
    mode: group_mastermix
    plate_ref: plate-huvec
    volume_per_unit: {value: 500, unit: uL}
    excess_ratio: 0.15
    components:
      - name: GelMA 凝胶前驱液
        target_percent: 5
      - name: LAP 光引发剂
        stock_percent: 2.5
        target_percent: 0.25
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-02-coat-uv
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 02 12 孔板铺胶与光固化接种
assay: assay-tube
timepoints: [6 h]
path: huvec/02-coat-uv
order: 2
blocks:
  - kind: param_table
    id: blk-huvec-uv-params
    schema: 1
    title: 光固化与接种参数
    rows:
      - key: gel_vol
        label: 每孔铺胶量
        value: 0.5
        unit: mL
      - key: uv_sec
        label: 光照固化时间
        value: 30
        unit: s
      - key: seed_cells
        label: 每孔接种细胞数
        value: 100000
        unit: cells/well
  - kind: timer
    id: blk-huvec-uv-timer
    schema: 1
    title: UV 光固化倒计时
    mode: countdown
    duration: {value: 30, unit: s}
  - kind: checklist
    id: blk-huvec-uv-chk
    schema: 1
    title: 铺胶与接种核查
    items:
      - id: chk-degas
        label: 水凝胶胶面无影响视野的气泡（已离心或目检跳过）
        blocking: true
        allow_rule_skip: true
        skip_rule: 无可见气泡时可豁免离心直接铺胶
      - id: chk-seed-t0
        label: 接种完成并记录 t0 时刻
        blocking: true
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-03-imaging
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 03 6h / 12h / 24h 明场多视野采图与成管定量
assay: assay-tube
timepoints: [6 h, 12 h, 24 h]
path: huvec/03-imaging
order: 3
blocks:
  - kind: timer
    id: blk-huvec-6h-timer
    schema: 1
    title: 成管 6h 首轮采图倒计时
    mode: countdown
    duration: {value: 6, unit: h}
    anchor: t0_seed
  - kind: attachment
    id: blk-huvec-fov-grid
    schema: 1
    title: 12 孔板每孔 3 视野明场图像网格
    scope: container_grid
    container_ref: plate-huvec
    slots_per_cell: 3
    note: 分别采集 6 h、12 h、24 h 同孔固定 3 视野用于总管长定量。
  - kind: data_table
    id: blk-huvec-metrics
    schema: 1
    title: HUVEC 成管图像定量汇总表
    schema_id: huvec_tube_metrics
    endpoint: tube_length
    columns:
      - key: well
        label: 孔位
        value_kind: text
      - key: total_length
        label: 管腔总长度
        value_kind: number
        unit: um
        min: 500
        max: 25000
      - key: meshes
        label: 网状结构数
        value_kind: number
        unit: 1
      - key: branches
        label: 分支节点数
        value_kind: number
        unit: 1
      - key: mean_branch_len
        label: 单支均长
        value_kind: formula
        formula: "total_length / branches"
        unit: um
    rows:
      - well: A1
        total_length: 8420
        meshes: 18
        branches: 42
      - well: B1
        total_length: 12650
        meshes: 29
        branches: 58
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-huvec
schema: 1
steps: [step-01-prep, step-02-coat-uv, step-03-imaging]
edges:
  - from: step-01-prep
    to: step-02-coat-uv
  - from: step-02-coat-uv
    to: step-03-imaging
```
